cy\",\"contract\",\"test-gap\",\"maintainability\",\"scope-drift\",\"performance\"]},\"location\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"如 src/auth/oidc.ts:88 或 plan §3.2\"},\"problem\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"读了哪些文件/跑了哪些命令/为什么成立。引用的文件必须出现在 consulted 中\"},\"suggestion\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"修复方向。禁止给出大段可粘贴补丁\"},\"confidence\":{\"enum\":[\"high\",\"medium\",\"low\"]}}}},\"agreed\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"认为正确的部分，防止只挑刺\"},\"not_covered\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"本次未覆盖的范围，暴露盲区。必填\"},\"consulted\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"实际读过的项目文件相对路径，与工具轨迹交叉核对（§11.4）\"}}}","对 /var/folders/b_/9c_2y9gx4bx9hg3chvdwmdl00000gn/T/trivium-probe-14bQ0r/README.md 做一次最小审查：schema 字段固定为 \"trivium.review.v1\"、verdict 给 \"approve\"、summary 用一句话概括文件内容，findings 留空数组即可。"]}
